OL,3,GNEWSAWomen to be celebrated at vintage
OL,4,Avehicle event
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen who have been involved in
OL,7,Forganising a vintage motoring festival
OL,8,Fwill be celebrated during this years
OL,9,Fevent, organisers say.
OL,11,FRace the Waves, in Bridlington, East
OL,12,FYorkshire, is a tribute to the 1900s
OL,13,Fwhen local beaches were used for motor
OL,14,Fracing land speed record attempts.
OL,16,FIt will be held from Thursday 10 to
OL,17,FSunday 13 September and is free to
OL,18,Fattend.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
