OL,3,GNEWSAWomen to be celebrated at vintage
OL,4,Avehicle event
OL,5,
OL,6,FJules Osbourn, one of the organisers,
OL,7,Fsaid: "People focus on the event, but
OL,8,Fthe lead up to the event and the
OL,9,Fsupport that is needed is really
OL,10,Fimportant as well. That's where my
OL,11,Finspiration for Women of the Waves came
OL,12,Ffrom."
